Begin3
Title:          NewsCache
Version:        0.99.14
Entered-date:   14JAN98
Description:    A free cache server for Usenet News. Reduces
		the required network bandwidth and the IO load of the
		news server. Additionally, it multiplexes between
		different news servers and allows offline news reading.
Keywords:       cache usenet news nntp multiplexing
Author:         tom@infosys.tuwien.ac.at (Thomas Gschwind)
Maintained-by:  tom@infosys.tuwien.ac.at (Thomas Gschwind)
Primary-site:   http://www.infosys.tuwien.ac.at/NewsCache/
Alternate-site: sunsite.unc.edu /pub/Linux/system/news/transport
		400kB newscache-0.9.8.tar.gz
Original-site:  http://www.infosys.tuwien.ac.at/NewsCache/
Platforms:      Un*x
Copying-policy: GPL
End
